 "html": "<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.2cqi\"><div style=\"background:#F4F6F9;padding:1.1cqi 1.3cqi;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.4cqi\"><div class=\"big\" style=\"color:#1F4FD8;font-size:3.4cqi\">269</div><div style=\"font-size:1.05cqi;line-height:1.3;color:#0B1220\">canvases sent something in September; 228 of them are marked \"archived\"</div></div><div style=\"background:#F4F6F9;padding:1.1cqi 1.3cqi;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.4cqi\"><div class=\"big\" style=\"color:#1F4FD8;font-size:3.4cqi\">12%</div><div style=\"font-size:1.05cqi;line-height:1.3;color:#0B1220\">of sends fire because the person did something; the other 88% go to lists</div></div><div style=\"background:#F4F6F9;padding:1.1cqi 1.3cqi;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.4cqi\"><div class=\"big\" style=\"color:#1F4FD8;font-size:3.4cqi\">3</div><div style=\"font-size:1.05cqi;line-height:1.3;color:#0B1220\">messages per customer per week, all teams (about 12 a month)</div></div><div style=\"background:#F4F6F9;padding:1.1cqi 1.3cqi;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.4cqi\"><div class=\"big\" style=\"color:#1F4FD8;font-size:3.4cqi\">96</div><div style=\"font-size:1.05cqi;line-height:1.3;color:#0B1220\">canvases sending in 2026 with no owner or audience; 748 communications with no team or ticket</div></div></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:62fr 38fr;gap:1.6cqi;margin-top:1.4cqi;align-items:stretch\"><div><table style=\"font-size:1.02cqi\"><tr><th style=\"padding:.4cqi .7cqi .4cqi 0\">Channel</th><th class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.4cqi .7cqi .4cqi 0\">Share of messages</th><th class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.4cqi .7cqi .4cqi 0\">Open rate</th><th class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.4cqi .7cqi .4cqi 0\">Click to open</th><th class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.4cqi .7cqi .4cqi 0\">Loans in 7 days, per month</th><th class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.4cqi .7cqi .4cqi 0\">Loans per 1,000 messages</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\"><b>Email</b></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\">50%</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\">23.7%</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\">3.9%</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\">185K</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\">5.0</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\"><b>Push</b></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\">38%</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\">1.5%</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\">n/a</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\">89K</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\">3.2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\"><b>WhatsApp</b></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\">8%</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\">68.9% read</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\">n/a</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\">39K</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\">6.4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\"><b>In-app</b></td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\">4%</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\">n/a</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\">38.2% click</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\">63K</td><td class=\"num\" style=\"padding:.42cqi .7cqi .42cqi 0\"><b style=color:#1F4FD8>20.7</b></td></tr></table></div><div><div style=\"background:#0B1A3A;padding:1.4cqi 1.6cqi;color:#FFFFFF;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.8cqi;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><div style=\"font-size:.9cqi;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:700;color:#8FA8EE\">WHAT WE SEE</div><div style=\"font-size:1.08cqi;line-height:1.38;color:#FFFFFF\"><b>1 ·</b> In-app wins 20.7 loans per 1,000 messages, four to six times email or push, yet carries only 4% of what we send.</div><div style=\"font-size:1.08cqi;line-height:1.38;color:#FFFFFF\"><b>2 ·</b> Email gets opened (24%) but only 4 in 100 who open it click; push is 38% of our messages and 1.5% open it.</div><div style=\"font-size:1.08cqi;line-height:1.38;color:#FFFFFF\"><b>3 ·</b> WhatsApp is 71% of the spend with 8% of the messages, and wins barely more loans per message than email.</div></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:1.4cqi;background:#E4F2EC;padding:.9cqi 1.3cqi;display:flex;gap:1.3cqi;align-items:center\"><div style=\"background:#127A5B;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:700;font-size:.9cqi;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:.5cqi 1cqi;border-radius:2cqi\">YOUR TURN · 5 MIN</div><div style=\"font-size:1.25cqi;font-weight:600;color:#0B1220\">Which of these numbers surprises you? Which one did you already expect?</div></div>",
 "fuente": "Source: Braze audit, January to September 2026. Loans = granted within 7 days of a message, split across that day's messages. WhatsApp read rate includes reads in the following month."
